  "description": "<p data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"654\"><strong data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"342\">EA Sports FC 24</strong> voor <strong data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"377\">Xbox Series X en Xbox One</strong> is de nieuwste voetbalgame van EA met realistische gameplay, officiële teams en competities. Dankzij verbeterde animaties, vernieuwde spelmechanieken en diverse spelmodi zoals Career Mode, Ultimate Team en Volta Football biedt FC 24 urenlang speelplezier voor elke voetbalfan.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"752\">Deze game verkeert in <strong data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"693\">goede staat</strong>, is getest en wordt geleverd <strong data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"751\">inclusief originele doos</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"781\">Belangrijkste kenmerken</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"1012\">\r\n<li data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"820\">\r\n<p data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"820\">Platform: Xbox Series X & Xbox One</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"847\">\r\n<p data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"847\">Genre: Sport / Voetbal</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"875\">\r\n<p data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"875\">Ontwikkelaar: EA Sports</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"919\">\r\n<p data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"919\">Officiële teams, spelers en competities</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"967\">\r\n<p data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"967\">Career Mode, Ultimate Team & Volta Football</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1012\">\r\n<p data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1012\">Geschikt voor singleplayer & multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1034\">Staat & levering</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1128\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1061\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1061\">Staat: <strong data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1059\">Goede staat</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1094\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1094\">Disc gecontroleerd en getest</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1128\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1128\"><strong data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1126\">Originele doos inbegrepen</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1177\">Waarom kiezen voor Used Products Apeldoorn?</h3>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1306\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1195\">Geteste games</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1225\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1225\">Originele doos inbegrepen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1259\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1259\">Direct uit voorraad leverbaar</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1306\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1306\">Afhalen in de winkel of verzenden mogelijk</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
